    "publication_date": "2024-01-22",
    "description": "<p>This data includes:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Torso.zip </strong>including torso geometry and electrode positions</li>\n<li><strong>vent-1..10.vtk </strong>the original segmentations corresponding to one single patient</li>\n<li><strong>shape-models.zip</strong> 261 shape models derived from the original segmentations<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong>StimProtocols</strong> coordinates of the stimulation sites</li>\n<li><strong>EikonalSim.zip&nbsp;</strong>eikonal simulations on shape models % stimProtocol</li>\n<li><strong>pseudoECGs_ShapeModels.zip </strong>computed body surface potentials for each shape model % stimProtocol</li>\n</ul>",
